    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyimbo ja mgunda wa mpeleya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano mjangu akuti, “Jemanja umkusatama ku Yelusalemu, soni ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda, ngumŵenda kuti mlamule sikati ja une ni mgunda wangu wa mpeleya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana pana cine soni cele cingatesile ni mgunda wangunewu, nambo nganinicitenda? Pele pinajembecelaga kuti tiwusogole mpeleya wambone, ligongo cici wasogwele yacabecabe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sambano mjime kaje nimsalile yitinjitenda nawo mgunda wangu wa mpeleya. Tinjityosya lutenje lwakwe, nipo mgundawo tiwucijonasika. Tinjigumula lipupa lyakwe, nipo yinyama tiyicilya ni kuyiliŵataliŵata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinjiwutenda kuŵa mgunda wangalimidwa, tiwuciŵa wangawukatila soni wangalimidwa, nipo miŵa tisicimela. Tinjigalamula mawunde kuti gakagwisya ula pa mgundapo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakusakala yakusayitenda ŵandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa jemanja ŵimkusagamba kusuma nyumba ŵele ŵakusagamba konjecesya migunda, mpaka kusumula malo gosope, kuti cilambo cosope ciŵe ca jemanjape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbikene AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope ali mkulumbila kuti: “Nditu, nyumba syejinji tisiciŵa masame; nyumba syekulungwa syakusalala tisiciŵa syangali ŵakutamamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgunda wa mpeleya wa ma ekala likumi, finyo jwakwe taciŵa malita makumi gaŵili ni gaŵili. Kumisa mbeju jakwana makilogalamu 220, yagowola yakwe tiyicigamba kuŵa makilogalamu makumi gaŵili ni gaŵili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa ŵele ŵakusajimuka kundaŵindaŵipe ni kuwutucilaga ku yakumwa yakolelwesya, ŵele ŵakusamwaga mpaka cilo kuyicila ali akolelwe mnope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akusajimba yida yakwimbila ya ngonji, ngoma, ni yitolilo, ni kumwaga finyo pa yindimba yawo. Nambo ŵangagasamala masengo ga AMBUJE, ŵangalola soni masengo gakugakamula ni makono gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu ŵangune tacijigalidwa kuŵa acikapolo, ligongo lya ungapikanicisya. Acimlongola ŵawo ŵakucimbicikwa taciwa ni sala, nipo ŵandu ŵane ŵajinji taciwa ni njota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ligongo lyakwe ku malembe kwangajikuta, nipo kuwugwile kukamwa mnope kwembecela kumpocela jwalijose. Ŵandu ŵakumanyika cenene mu Yelusalemu yalumo ni ŵandu wamba ŵajinji, tacigwila m'malembe ali topitopi, ni kukolelwa kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwalijose tacitesyedwa soni ni wosope ŵakulikwesya tacanandiya soni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope, tacipocela ucimbicimbi ligongo lya cilungamo cawo, Mlungu Jwamswela tacilosya uswela wakwe, pakutenda yakulungama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano ŵanace ŵangondolo tacilya pelepo mpela pa mopo, nipo ŵanace ŵa mbusi tacilya ku masame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa wosope ŵakusalijigalila ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wejinji pakuŵeceta ya unami, ŵele ŵakusalepela kuligopola ku ulemwa wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵele ŵakusaŵeceta kuti, “AMBUJE ajanguye, akamule masengo gakwe mwakwanguya, kuti tugalole masengo gakwe. Mlungu Jwamswela jwa Aisalaeli atende yakuyiganisya, yitendekwe kuti tuyimanye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa ŵele yakusakala akusayiwona mpela yambone nipo yambone akusayiwona mpela yakusakala, ŵele cipi akusaciwona mpela lilanguka, nipo lilanguka akusaliwona mpela cipi, ŵele yakuŵaŵa akusayiwona mpela yakulyolyopela, nipo yakulyolyopela akusayiwona mpela yakuŵaŵa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa ŵele ŵakusaganisya kuti ali ŵalunda, nipo akusapela kuti ali ŵakalamuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa acalume ŵamacili ŵakusakolelwa mnope, ŵele ŵakuŵika umi wawo wosope pa kuwanganya finyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akusiŵalungamisya ŵandu ŵakulemwa ligongo lya yipupu ni kugasakasya magambo ga mundu jwangalemwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mpela moto muwukusajonanjila ciputu, mpela soni mwele manyasi gejumu gakusapila pamoto, myoyo soni miciga jawo tijiciwola, nipo maluŵa gawo tigacijumula ni kuguluka mpela luwundu, ligongo ŵakanile Malamusi ga AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope ni kuganyosya maloŵe ga Ŵaswela ŵala ŵa Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ni ligongo lyakwe ukali wa AMBUJE wakolelele ŵandu ŵakwe. Jwalakwejo atambalalisye ligasa lyakwe pa ŵanduwo kuti ŵape cilango. Matumbi tigatenganyice, nipo mitembo ja ŵanduwo jigambile kuti mbwee mpela yiswani pasikati pa misewu. Nambo naga Mlungu atesile myoyo, lutumbilo lwawo nganilumala, ligasa lyakwe lili citambasukulile kuti ŵape cilango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
