              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE tacipeleka cimanyisyo kwaŵilanga ŵandu ŵa mtundu ŵakutali. Tacaŵilanga ŵanduwo ni lulusi kuti ayice kutyocela ku mbesi kwa cilambo capasi. Kaneko jemanjajo taciyika mwakuwutuka mnope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pangali atamose jumo jutacipela kapena kukuŵala, pangali jwagwesela kapena kugona, pangali lamba jwamciwunu jutacigopoka, pangali lukonji lwakutaŵila sapato syawo lutucikatika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mipamba jawo jili jakutema, mawukunje gawo gosope gali gakuwuta, yiboda ya mahaci gawo yili yakulimba mpela liganga, yigeleta yawo yili yakuwutuka mnope mpela cimbunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubangula kwawo kuli mpela kwa lisimba, akusabangula mpela ŵanace ŵa lisimba, ŵele gakusalaga pakujikamula nyama, ni kwawulaga nasyo pali pangali atamose ni jumo jose jwakuyikulupusya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
